Package: fosos-installer
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: calamares, squashfs-tools, rsync, grub-efi-amd64-bin, grub2-common, grub-common, efibootmgr, cryptsetup, cryptsetup-initramfs, os-prober, pkexec, sudo, qt6-qpa-plugins, qt6-gtk-platformtheme, qt6-svg-plugins, x11-xserver-utils
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS graphical installer
 Calamares configuration and branding for installing FosOS.
 Covers partitioning, optional disk encryption, locale, timezone,
 keyboard, and the account that will own the installed system.
